# @tale/{{kebabCase name}}

{{description}}

Shell-based tooling for the Tale monorepo. The logic lives in `run.sh`; the
`package.json` makes it a workspace member so it can be invoked uniformly.

## Usage

```bash
bun run --filter @tale/{{kebabCase name}} run
# or directly:
bash tools/{{kebabCase name}}/run.sh
```
